<title>USA: AMEX to list three new equity options on July 31.</title>
<headline>AMEX to list three new equity options on July 31.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The American Stock Exchange</p>
<p>(AMEX) said Tuesday it will list options on Monterey Resources</p>
<p>Inc, Renal Care Group Inc and Rural/Metro Corp on Thursday,</p>
<p>July 31.</p>
<p>Strikes	 Expir	 Pos Lts   Specialist</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>12-1/2, 15,   Aug, Sep,   7,500     AGS Specialist</p>
<p>17-1/2	  Oct, Jan		  Partners</p>
<p>22-1/2, 25,   Aug, Sep,   4,500     TFM Investment</p>
<p>30		Dec, Mar		  Group</p>
<p>22-1/2, 25,   Aug, Sep,   4,500     TFM Investment</p>
<p>30		Dec, Mar		  Group</p>
<p>((--Chicago derivatives desk, 312 408 8750))</p>
